'''Cookie''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 9th tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is brown with chocolate chips all over it, resembling a chocolate chip cookie, hence the name. The guard and handle are brown, but don’t have any chocolate chips. 

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Cookie (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

